    "description": "<p><em>In the tranquillity of meditation, you recover your inner discipline more reliably and replenish magical reserves more efficiently.</em></p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisites</strong> Meditation 1 rank</p>\n<p>The first time each day that you use Refocus, improve the result by one degree, to a maximum of Critical. The first time each day that you use Power Recovery (Meditation), double the amount of PP restored.</p>\n<p><em>Applied automatically:</em> your first Refocus each day resolves one degree better, to a maximum of Critical (the card says so), and your first Power Recovery check during a rest each day restores double the PP. Daily preparation starts the count again.</p>",
